@page "/privacy"
@using LouisAgent.Site.Content.Privacy

<PageTitle>Your privacy · louis-agent</PageTitle>
<PageHead Description="What louis-agent.dev keeps when you talk to Orbi, its AI agent, what it sends, who sees it, and your rights under POPIA." />

@* The privacy page (F145.1), beside the CV as a page about who runs the site: what the site keeps and sends, in the order a visitor meets it, then their rights under
   POPIA, configured on the framework's band and tiles (ADR 0125), its tiles' words in PrivacyWords (ADR 0132). Every
   line says what the code does today. *@
<Band Id="top" Topic="Privacy" Title="What happens to what you type." Summary="Orbi is the AI agent at the foot of every page. This is what it keeps, what it sends and who sees it. Your words are used to answer you, and your details reach us only when you say send.">
    <TileRow Columns="2">
        @for (var index = 0; index < PrivacyWords.WhatIsKept.InOrder.Count; index++)
        {
            var tile = PrivacyWords.WhatIsKept.InOrder[index];
            <Tile Icon="tile.Icon" Title="@tile.Title" Text="@tile.Text" Delay="index % 2" />
        }
    </TileRow>
</Band>

<Band Id="rights" Topic="Your rights" Title="Ask, correct, delete." Summary="Under POPIA, South Africa's privacy law, you may ask what we hold about you, have it corrected or deleted, and object to how it is used. The person who runs this site and answers for it is Louis Marais.">
    <TileRow Columns="2">
        <Tile Title="Ask us" Text="Write one mail saying what you want, and we answer it.">
            <Actions>
                <LinkButton Href="mailto:louis.marais@live.com?subject=My%20privacy" Text="Write to us" />
            </Actions>
        </Tile>
        <Tile Title="Not happy with the answer?" Delay="1" Text="You may complain to the Information Regulator, who oversees POPIA in South Africa.">
            <Actions>
                <LinkButton Href="https://inforegulator.org.za" Text="The Information Regulator" Kind="ButtonKind.Quiet" NewTab="true" />
            </Actions>
        </Tile>
    </TileRow>
</Band>
